{"lines":[{"h":0.014994866154359521,"c":1,"y":0.059363032012923922,"x":0.8599753086445473,"w":0.061942386627197199,"t":"Test 6"},{"x":0.084337457039698555,"w":0.059720147450764982,"c":1,"h":0.008891085432611967,"y":0.10892655029109388,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"w":0.037037035624186213,"y":0.12499999989437793,"t":"MAN:","x":0.084362140521240234,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"y":0.15548353641991319,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"w":0.057637157440185549,"x":0.084350145460627912,"h":0.0088003689886122505},{"x":0.084362140319105453,"t":"MAN:","c":1,"w":0.034979422887166337,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.17005813940953829},{"h":0.010295921837904509,"w":0.059712066650390624,"y":0.18598575999394784,"c":1,"x":0.082283884267326121,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.20203488360123734,"t":"MAN:","x":0.082304525973195389,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120443},{"h":0.0087971501973829191,"w":0.057636191050211588,"y":0.21653165744315706,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"x":0.084350628648081544},{"x":0.082304525973195389,"y":0.23255813939809178,"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"MAN:"},{"x":0.084282930486609051,"w":0.05777158737182618,"h":0.010631705060583752,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.24686438000835054},{"w":0.037037035624186185,"x":0.082304527352515949,"t":"MAN:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.26308139520800777,"c":1},{"y":0.29315183885089469,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.080098707625253812,"h":0.011080043195133671,"c":1,"w":0.059967193603515628},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"y":0.32412790685853876,"x":0.080246912810186685,"t":"MAN:","w":0.039094651540120443},{"w":0.061728394826253252,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.082304526756479479,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.34011627897582519},{"x":0.16049383774489409,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Oh, that'd be nice. Where's that being held?","y":0.1045347467830865,"w":0.35185183207194004,"c":1},{"t":"It's in the market in the town centre - the outdoor one, not the covered market. And Q9","h":0.01453830777405285,"c":1,"y":0.12209302312306125,"w":0.70370371500651052,"x":0.16049382140620982},{"t":"it's on at 2 and 5 every afternoon of the festival, apart from the first day.","x":0.15843621987195908,"w":0.57201644897460935,"y":0.1366279068422217,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.15843621357492196,"y":0.15253239098028282,"t":"Lovely. I'm interested in all kinds of dancing, so I'm sure I'Il enjoy that!","w":0.5576131693522135,"c":1},{"t":"Mmm. I'm sure you will.","y":0.1686046510241892,"x":0.16049382509192861,"c":1,"w":0.19341564178466797,"h":0.014552004064912638},{"y":0.18313953474888045,"t":"And I'd really like to go to some concerts, if there are any.","c":1,"w":0.46090535481770839,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.16049382451597122},{"t":"Yes, there are several. Three performed by professionals, and one by local children.","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.16049383521542418,"w":0.66872426350911462,"y":0.19905771516517234},{"h":0.016385474952005707,"c":1,"t":"And where is it being held?","x":0.1582650700874951,"y":0.21326507221283741,"w":0.22260678609212239},{"c":1,"t":"It's in the library, which is in Park Street. On the 18hh, at 6.30 in the evening.","x":0.15843622505686569,"y":0.22673733757382064,"w":0.60493825276692703,"h":0.018902196760593237},{"w":0.27366254170735671,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.15843621875459576,"y":0.24558303882511834,"t":"I presume IIl need tickets for that."},{"y":0.26017441846902389,"t":"Yes, you can book online, or you can buy them when you arrive in Kenton, either at. Q10","w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.014560564106288587,"c":1,"x":0.15843622374815625},{"y":0.27616279056417525,"x":0.15843621419714016,"t":"the festival box office, or from any shops displaying our logo in the windows.","w":0.60905349731445313,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"t":"Well, I think that'll keep me busy for the whole of my stay in Kenton. Thank you so","w":0.65226338704427089,"x":0.15843620759872218,"y":0.29063604264775933,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"much for all your help.","h":0.014574259835502756,"x":0.15843621561754376,"y":0.30668604636803498,"w":0.1831275685628255},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"You're welcome. I hope you enjoy your stay.","w":0.35390945434570309,"c":1,"x":0.15843621921929629,"y":0.32267441846952205},{"y":0.33716136628956095,"t":"Thank you. Goodbye.","h":0.014723203769140047,"x":0.1563786006174657,"w":0.18106995900472003,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"SECTION 2","x":0.082304523990562095,"y":0.38662790681256942,"w":0.15637860616048177,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"w":0.71810699462890626,"c":1,"t":"Right. I've now almost succeeded in finalising plans for our tour, so Ill bring you up to date","x":0.082304527272824446,"y":0.41569767428587057,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.14252489725748699,"y":0.42922550829078721,"x":0.080015198150055228,"t":"with what I know.","h":0.015682560816249191,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.48176294962565103,"x":0.080100114345086321,"t":"As you know, we're flying first to Munich, on Monday the 4th","y":0.45046530081265002,"h":0.022527739633800503},{"w":0.78806584676106761,"t":"The flight is at 11.30, so it's too early to have lunch at the airport. Lsuggest we meet there for Q11","x":0.080246911808363561,"c":1,"h":0.015995219964161089,"y":0.47673733831492981},{"t":"coffee at 10, which should give us plenty of time for breakfast before we leave home.","x":0.080246911589092015,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.49263839809969479,"c":1,"w":0.67901234944661459},{"t":"When we arrive in Munich, we'll be met at the airport by Claus Bauer. Claus works for a tour","y":0.51590106022538473,"x":0.080246903106267573,"c":1,"w":0.73456792195638021,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"x":0.082304533761734716,"w":0.70576131184895829,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"y":0.530523256094528,"t":"operator, and he'll look after us for the time we'll be in Germany. He's already liaised with"},{"x":0.080246920401844765,"c":1,"t":"the managers of the theatres we're going to visit, and he's also arranged for an officer of the","y":0.54651162777377515,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.73251027425130211},{"c":1,"t":"National Theatre in Munich to show us round the theatre one afternoon during our stay.","h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.56242638384830979,"w":0.69341562906901033,"x":0.080246917869430667},{"y":0.58421672542572112,"w":0.72222218831380214,"x":0.080246929155856225,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"t":"Now last time we discussed this trip, I didn't have the precise cost for hotel rooms, but now"},{"t":"I have. The normal rate at the hotel where we're staying is 150 euros a night for a double","x":0.078134568200098703,"y":0.59852303171718713,"h":0.017913083165217114,"c":1,"w":0.709985097249349},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q13","y":0.60174418589048317,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.83333333394292997},{"x":0.078189291826893076,"c":1,"y":0.61627906963430312,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.72222223917643236,"t":"room. I'd hoped to get that down to 120 euros, but in fact l've been able to negotiate a rate"},{"y":0.63221436958351707,"t":"of 110. Thatll be reflected in the final payment which you'll need to make by the end of this","w":0.72222223917643225,"x":0.078189291832140378,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"y":0.67005813940216197,"w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.014570836043610536,"c":1,"x":0.080246915047498715,"t":"On Tuesday, the day after our arrival, I had hoped we could sit in on a rehearsal at one of"},{"c":1,"y":0.68604651149508944,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"the theatres, but unfortunately that's proved very difficult to arrange, so instead we'll have a","w":0.72839508056640623,"x":0.078189290882777693},{"t":"coach trip to one of the amazing castles in the mountains south of Munich.","x":0.080246907340927015,"w":0.59465021769205728,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.70053003553706794},{"c":1,"y":0.72374035451536001,"t":"On Tuesday evening, we'll all have dinner together in a restaurant near our hotel. From","h":0.015019273589440885,"x":0.080214277887374882,"w":0.69348871866861983},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.07613167678114223,"y":0.73969375741169785,"c":1,"t":"talking to you all about your preferences, it was clear that a typical local restaurant would be","w":0.73456792195638021},{"w":0.72839508056640623,"y":0.7558139533553343,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"too meat-oriented for some of you. Some of you suggested an Italian restaurant, but I must","x":0.078189290893065699},{"x":0.078189321918201715,"w":0.72222218831380214,"h":0.014565699232481077,"t":"confess that I decided to book a Lebanese one, as we have plenty of opportunities to go to","c":1,"y":0.77031802108503511},{"h":0.014375975331372692,"y":0.78509547989373629,"x":0.080134875211088807,"c":1,"w":0.23690231323242189,"t":"an Italian restaurant at home."},{"w":0.7366255187988282,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.80948174314687482,"c":1,"t":"On Wednesday afternoon, the director of the play we're going to see that evening will talk to","x":0.078189298109400063},{"t":"us at the theatre. She'll describe the whole process of producing a play, including how she","h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.71604939778645837,"y":0.82412790685244752,"x":0.080246905913524902,"c":1},{"w":0.73251027425130211,"t":"chose the actors, and, as the play we're going to see is a modern one, how she worked with","h":0.014545155919482688,"c":1,"y":0.84010600699912863,"x":0.080246920412556239},{"x":0.076131690122602791,"t":"the playwright.","h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.85600706733381604,"c":1,"w":0.11934155782063802},{"t":"Q14","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.75581395332993895,"x":0.83333333393687814,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"x":0.83333333393687814,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.8095930230973809,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q15"},{"y":0.93313953472528788,"t":"101","c":1,"x":0.87860082364881231,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258536995222,"w":0.20824633280436194,"h":0.016454192297478354,"x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1}],"h":3395,"w":2400}